
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.GetColor(Face: number): vector`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`vector llGetColor(integer Face);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a vector that is the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PBR_Materials#Nomenclature_changes" target="_blank">Blinn-Phong</a> color on <b>face</b>.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>Face / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/face" target="_blank">face</a></td>
          <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Face" target="_blank">face</a> number or <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/ALL_SIDES" target="_blank">ALL_SIDES</a></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>prim</li>
        <li>prim_appearance</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">52</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="attr-label bg-mandatory">Use Return</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <p>If <b>face</b> is <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/ALL_SIDES" target="_blank">ALL_SIDES</a> then the function returns the average color of all the faces on the prim.[[1]](#footnote_1)</p>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>If <b>face</b> indicates a face that does not exist the return is <0.0, 0.0, 0.0></li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`-- Tells the owner the color on all sides
local function main()
    local i = 0
    local max = ll.GetNumberOfSides()
    while i < max do
        ll.OwnerSay("Face " .. tostring(i) .. " color is " .. tostring(ll.GetColor(i)))
        i += 1
    end
end

main()
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`// Tells the owner the color on all sides
default
{
    state_entry()
    {
        integer i = 0;
        integer max = llGetNumberOfSides();
        while(i < max)
        {
            llOwnerSay("Face " + (string) i + " color is " + (string) llGetColor(i));
            ++i;
        }
    }
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
